{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barOdd_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barOdd_mul","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BarParityZeta4Swap.lean#L107-L112","doc":"**Rapidities add (sinh law).** The bar-odd (decay–binding / `sinh`) companion\nof `barEven_mul`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barEven_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barEven_mul","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BarParityZeta4Swap.lean#L99-L105","doc":"**Rapidities add (cosh law).** Composing turns multiplies the arguments; the\nbar-even (mass / `cosh`) shape obeys the addition formula. Generic bar-involution\nmultiplicativity — lives with `barEven`/`barOdd` (moved here from the cusp module). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barEven_zeta_sq_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barEven_zeta_sq_mul","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BarParityZeta4Swap.lean#L92-L97","doc":"Two quarter-turns (`ζ²x = -x`) negate the bar-even shape — the `ζ₄` period-4\nrotation `even → ζ·odd → -even → -ζ·odd → even`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barOdd_zeta_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barOdd_zeta_mul","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BarParityZeta4Swap.lean#L84-L90","doc":"**ζ₄ swap, odd → even.** The companion: the quarter-turn carries the bar-ODD\nshape to `ζ` times the bar-EVEN shape. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barEven_zeta_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barEven_zeta_mul","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BarParityZeta4Swap.lean#L76-L82","doc":"**ζ₄ swap, even → odd.** With `ζ² = -1`, the quarter-turn `x ↦ ζx` carries the\nbar-EVEN (mass) shape to `ζ` times the bar-ODD (decay/binding) shape. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.inv_eq_neg_of_sq_eq_neg_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.inv_eq_neg_of_sq_eq_neg_one","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BarParityZeta4Swap.lean#L70-L74","doc":"The inverse of a primitive fourth root of unity is its negative: `ζ⁻¹ = -ζ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barOdd_bar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barOdd_bar","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BarParityZeta4Swap.lean#L66-L68","doc":"`barOdd` is negated by the bar involution `x ↦ x⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barEven_bar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barEven_bar","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BarParityZeta4Swap.lean#L62-L64","doc":"`barEven` is invariant under the bar involution `x ↦ x⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barOdd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barOdd","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BarParityZeta4Swap.lean#L59-L60","doc":"Bar-odd (`sinh`-like) shape: `x − x⁻¹`, negated by the bar involution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barEven","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BarParityZeta4Swap.barEven","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BarParityZeta4Swap.lean#L56-L57","doc":"Bar-even (`cosh`-like) shape: `x + x⁻¹`, fixed by the bar involution. ","signatureChunk":0}]}